      "characters": 11,
      "text": "The History"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 223,
      "text": "Initially part of the IPBES Data TSU in Frankfurt\nPotential not only within IPBES\nPartnership with SIB (Swiss Institute of Bioinformatics)\nNow housed as Literature Pillar in Environmental Bioinformatics Group, SIB, Lausanne"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 17,
      "text": "Areas of Activity"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 27,
      "text": "Benefits of new Arrangement"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 312,
      "text": "Support for IPBES through IPBES TSU\nOpenAlex\nDevelopment of Interface to do Literature Search and Analysis of huge Literature Corpora openalexPro Ecosystem [R]\nGrey Literature\nUtilising Search Engines for Grey Literature Search\nIntegration into openalexPro Ecosystem [R]\nCooperation with Plazi / Disentis Roadmap"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
