      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 191,
      "text": "Intensification of Literature Work\nLitCoP will play an important role\nProviding Support to other Organisations\nLitCoP will play an important role\nEstablishing Sustainable Funding arrangements"
